# Nothing here is read at build time or at runtime, and all of it is uploaded
# and traced into every deployment without this file.
#
# `reports/` is 677MB, almost entirely screenshots: every report this repository
# has ever written keeps the photographs it argued from, which is right for the
# record and pointless in a serverless bundle. The build's own Turbopack warning
# says the project is being traced whole — "Encountered unexpected file in NFT
# list" — so without this they are not merely uploaded, they are candidates for
# the function bundle Vercel size-limits.
#
# `decisions/` is deliberately NOT here: `(marketing)/_lib/copy.ts` counts the
# records at build time, so excluding it would change what the site says about
# itself.
reports/
